  "claims": [
    {
      "claim_id": "large_marble_departure_angle",
      "statement": "For large marbles (Ω>7 μL), the departure angle α is given by α≈(1/2)(1+sqrt(8πa^3/Ω)) μ f(φ)/(1-f(φ)), with fitted μ=0.053±0.003, f(φ_o)=0.26, a(φ_o)=2.3 mm. The model agrees with data over two decades in volume from 3 to 300 μL.",
